    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a clever liquid-measuring game ! Given a 5-liter cup and a 3-liter cup, how can you measure exactly 4 liters of water? You start with two empty cups and can perform three actions: fill a cup to the brim, empty it completely, or pour from one cup to the other until either the first cup is empty or the second is full. The game features <strong>103 carefully designed puzzles</strong> of increasing difficulty, challenging your problem-solving skills step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Game Instruction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to choose a cup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After select a cup , Right-click to pour water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing extra, only pure puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Euclid whispered this game idea in my dream (true story).</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a clever liquid-measuring game ! Given a 5-liter cup and a 3-liter cup, how can you measure exactly 4 liters of water? You start with two empty cups and can perform three actions: fill a cup to the brim, empty it completely, or pour from one cup to the other until either the first cup is empty or the second is full. The game features <strong>103 carefully designed puzzles</strong> of increasing difficulty, challenging your problem-solving skills step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Game Instruction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to choose a cup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After select a cup , Right-click to pour water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing extra, only pure puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Euclid whispered this game idea in my dream (true story).</i></p>",
